---
import Toggletip from '../Toggletip.astro';
interface Props { lang?: 'en' | 'zh' | 'ja' | 'ko' }
const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;

// strings:start
const STRINGS = {
  "en": {
    "copy": "Copy",
    "copied": "Copied!",
    "copyFailed": "Copy failed",
    "clear": "Clear",
    "alignment": "Column Alignment",
    "alignLeft": "Left",
    "alignCenter": "Center",
    "alignRight": "Right",
    "converted": "Converted {n} row{s} to Markdown table.",
    "errorPrefix": "Error: ",
    "addedColumns": "Some rows have more fields than the header, so these columns were added: {cols}.",
    "errNoData": "No data found.",
    "empty": "The Markdown table will appear here.",
    "tips": {
      "csv": "Paste comma-separated CSV. The first row becomes the header. After 0.3 seconds without typing, the table updates. Quoted commas and line breaks are supported.",
      "alignment": "Left, Center or Right applies to every column and immediately updates existing input. The separator row controls alignment in a Markdown renderer.",
      "markdown": "The output is a Markdown table. Pipes inside cells are escaped and line breaks become spaces. Extra cells add named columns; the status lists them.",
      "copyCsv": "Copies the complete current CSV input. An empty input cannot be copied.",
      "copyMd": "Copies the complete generated Markdown table for use in GitHub, GitLab or a Markdown editor. An empty result cannot be copied.",
      "clear": "Clears both panes, the status and pending conversion. Alignment stays selected. Ctrl+L (⌘+L on Mac) also clears while focus is inside this tool."
    }
  },
  "zh": {
    "copy": "复制",
    "copied": "已复制！",
    "copyFailed": "复制失败",
    "clear": "清除",
    "alignment": "列对齐",
    "alignLeft": "左对齐",
    "alignCenter": "居中",
    "alignRight": "右对齐",
    "converted": "已将 {n} 行转换为 Markdown 表格。",
    "errorPrefix": "错误：",
    "addedColumns": "部分行的字段比表头多，已补上这些列：{cols}。",
    "errNoData": "没有找到数据。",
    "empty": "Markdown 表格将显示在这里。",
    "tips": {
      "csv": "粘贴逗号分隔的 CSV，第一行作为表头。停止输入 0.3 秒后自动更新表格。支持引号字段内的逗号与换行。",
      "alignment": "左对齐、居中或右对齐应用于所有列，并立即更新已有输入的结果。分隔行决定 Markdown 渲染器中的对齐方式。",
      "markdown": "输出为 Markdown 表格。单元格中的竖线会转义，换行变为空格。多出的字段会补为命名列，状态行会列出这些列。",
      "copyCsv": "复制当前 CSV 输入的全部文本。输入为空时无法复制。",
      "copyMd": "复制生成的完整 Markdown 表格，可用于 GitHub、GitLab 或 Markdown 编辑器。结果为空时无法复制。",
      "clear": "清空两个面板、状态和等待执行的转换，保留对齐方式。焦点在工具内时，Ctrl+L（Mac 为 ⌘+L）也会清空。"
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "copy": "コピー",
    "copied": "コピー済み！",
    "copyFailed": "コピー失敗",
    "clear": "クリア",
    "alignment": "列の配置",
    "alignLeft": "左揃え",
    "alignCenter": "中央揃え",
    "alignRight": "右揃え",
    "converted": "{n} 行を Markdown テーブルに変換しました。",
    "errorPrefix": "エラー：",
    "addedColumns": "ヘッダーより項目が多い行があるため、次の列を追加しました：{cols}。",
    "errNoData": "データがありません。",
    "empty": "Markdown テーブルがここに表示されます。",
    "tips": {
      "csv": "カンマ区切りの CSV を貼り付けます。1行目がヘッダーになり、入力を止めて0.3秒後に表が更新されます。引用符内のカンマや改行に対応します。",
      "alignment": "左揃え・中央揃え・右揃えを全列に適用し、既存の入力の結果をすぐに更新します。区切り行が Markdown レンダラーの配置を決めます。",
      "markdown": "Markdown テーブルを出力します。セル内のパイプはエスケープし、改行は空白にします。余分なセルには名前付きの列を追加し、ステータスに表示します。",
      "copyCsv": "現在の CSV 入力の全文をコピーします。空の入力はコピーできません。",
      "copyMd": "生成された Markdown テーブル全体をコピーし、GitHub、GitLab や Markdown エディターで使えます。空の結果はコピーできません。",
      "clear": "両方の欄、ステータス、待機中の変換をクリアし、配置は保持します。ツール内にフォーカスがある場合は Ctrl+L（Mac は ⌘+L）でもクリアできます。"
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "copy": "복사",
    "copied": "복사됨!",
    "copyFailed": "복사 실패",
    "clear": "지우기",
    "alignment": "열 정렬",
    "alignLeft": "왼쪽",
    "alignCenter": "가운데",
    "alignRight": "오른쪽",
    "converted": "{n}행을 Markdown 표로 변환했습니다.",
    "errorPrefix": "오류: ",
    "addedColumns": "헤더보다 필드가 많은 행이 있어 다음 열을 추가했습니다: {cols}.",
    "errNoData": "데이터가 없습니다.",
    "empty": "Markdown 표가 여기에 표시됩니다.",
    "tips": {
      "csv": "쉼표로 구분한 CSV를 붙여 넣습니다. 첫 행을 헤더로 사용하며 입력을 멈춘 뒤 0.3초 후 표가 갱신됩니다. 따옴표 안의 쉼표와 줄바꿈을 지원합니다.",
      "alignment": "왼쪽, 가운데 또는 오른쪽을 모든 열에 적용하고 기존 입력의 결과를 바로 갱신합니다. 구분 행이 Markdown 렌더러의 정렬을 결정합니다.",
      "markdown": "Markdown 표를 출력합니다. 셀 안의 파이프는 이스케이프하고 줄바꿈은 공백으로 바꿉니다. 여분의 필드는 이름이 있는 열로 추가하며 상태에 표시합니다.",
      "copyCsv": "현재 CSV 입력의 전체 텍스트를 복사합니다. 빈 입력은 복사할 수 없습니다.",
      "copyMd": "생성된 Markdown 표 전체를 복사하여 GitHub, GitLab 또는 Markdown 편집기에서 사용할 수 있습니다. 빈 결과는 복사할 수 없습니다.",
      "clear": "두 패널, 상태, 대기 중인 변환을 지우고 정렬은 유지합니다. 도구 안에 초점이 있으면 Ctrl+L(Mac은 ⌘+L)로도 지울 수 있습니다."
    }
  }
};
// strings:end
const T = STRINGS[lang] || STRINGS.en;
const { tips: TIPS, ...CLIENT } = T;
---

<div class="cm-wrap" data-strings={JSON.stringify(CLIENT)}>
  <div class="cm-toolbar">
    <div class="cm-control"><span id="cm-alignment-label" class="cm-opt-label">{T.alignment}</span><Toggletip id="cm-tip-alignment" lang={lang} about={T.alignment}>{TIPS.alignment}</Toggletip></div>
    <div class="cm-align-btns zt-segmented" role="group" aria-labelledby="cm-alignment-label">
      <button id="cm-align-left" class="cm-align-btn active" data-align="left" type="button">{T.alignLeft}</button>
      <button id="cm-align-center" class="cm-align-btn" data-align="center" type="button">{T.alignCenter}</button>
      <button id="cm-align-right" class="cm-align-btn" data-align="right" type="button">{T.alignRight}</button>
    </div>
    <div class="cm-control"><button id="cm-clear" class="btn-ghost" type="button">{T.clear}</button><Toggletip id="cm-tip-clear" lang={lang} about={T.clear}>{TIPS.clear}</Toggletip></div>
  </div>
  <div id="cm-status" class="cm-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <div class="cm-panels zt-io">
    <div class="cm-panel zt-io-pane">
      <div class="cm-head">
        <div class="cm-control"><label for="cm-csv">CSV</label><Toggletip id="cm-tip-csv" lang={lang} about="CSV">{TIPS.csv}</Toggletip></div>
        <div class="cm-control"><button id="cm-copy-csv" class="btn-copy" type="button">{T.copy}</button><Toggletip id="cm-tip-copy-csv" lang={lang} about={T.copy + ' CSV'}>{TIPS.copyCsv}</Toggletip></div>
      </div>
      <textarea id="cm-csv" class="tool-textarea cm-box zt-io-fill" placeholder="name,age,city&#10;Alice,30,&quot;New York&quot;&#10;Bob,25,London" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div class="cm-panel cm-result-pane zt-io-pane">
      <div class="cm-head">
        <div class="cm-control"><label for="cm-md">Markdown</label><Toggletip id="cm-tip-markdown" lang={lang} about="Markdown">{TIPS.markdown}</Toggletip></div>
        <div class="cm-control"><button id="cm-copy-md" class="btn-copy" type="button">{T.copy}</button><Toggletip id="cm-tip-copy-md" lang={lang} about={T.copy + ' Markdown'}>{TIPS.copyMd}</Toggletip></div>
      </div>
      <textarea id="cm-md" class="tool-textarea cm-box zt-io-fill" placeholder=" " spellcheck="false" readonly></textarea>
      <div class="cm-empty zt-io-fill">{T.empty}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var t = JSON.parse(document.querySelector('.cm-wrap').dataset.strings || '{}');

      var csvEl = document.getElementById('cm-csv');
      var mdEl = document.getElementById('cm-md');
      var statusEl = document.getElementById('cm-status');
      var copyCsvBtn = document.getElementById('cm-copy-csv');
      var copyMdBtn = document.getElementById('cm-copy-md');
      var currentAlign = 'left';
      var copyStates = [
        { button: copyCsvBtn, revision: 0, timer: null },
        { button: copyMdBtn, revision: 0, timer: null }
      ];

      /* ── Alignment buttons ── */
      document.querySelectorAll('.cm-align-btn').forEach(function (btn) {
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          document.querySelectorAll('.cm-align-btn').forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
          btn.classList.add('active');
          currentAlign = btn.getAttribute('data-align');
          if (csvEl.value.trim()) doConvert();
          trackChange();
        });
      });

      function rowMsg(n) {
        return t.converted.replace('{n}', n).replace('{s}', n === 1 ? '' : 's');
      }

      function setStatus(msg, isError) {
        statusEl.textContent = msg;
        statusEl.className = 'cm-status ' + (isError ? 'error' : 'success');
      }

      function clearStatus() {
        statusEl.textContent = '';
        statusEl.className = 'cm-status';
      }

      /* ── engine:start ── */
      /* ── CSV parser: handles quoted fields ── */
      function parseCsv(text) {
        if (text.charCodeAt(0) === 0xFEFF) text = text.slice(1); /* UTF-8 BOM from Excel "CSV UTF-8" */
        var rows = [];
        var row = [];
        var field = '';
        var inQuote = false;
        var i = 0;
        var len = text.length;

        while (i < len) {
          var ch = text[i];
          if (inQuote) {
            if (ch === '"') {
              if (i + 1 < len && text[i + 1] === '"') { field += '"'; i += 2; }
              else { inQuote = false; i++; }
            } else { field += ch; i++; }
          } else {
            if (ch === '"') { inQuote = true; i++; }
            else if (ch === ',') { row.push(field); field = ''; i++; }
            else if (ch === '\r') {
              row.push(field); field = ''; rows.push(row); row = []; i++;
              if (i < len && text[i] === '\n') i++;
            } else if (ch === '\n') { row.push(field); field = ''; rows.push(row); row = []; i++; }
            else { field += ch; i++; }
          }
        }
        if (field || row.length > 0) { row.push(field); rows.push(row); }
        if (rows.length > 0) { var last = rows[rows.length - 1]; if (last.length === 1 && last[0] === '') rows.pop(); }
        return rows;
      }

      /* ── Escape Markdown pipe chars ── */
      function escapeMd(val) {
        return val.replace(/\|/g, '\\|').replace(/\r\n|\r|\n/g, ' ');
      }

      /* ── Build separator line based on alignment ── */
      function sepCell(width, align) {
        if (align === 'center') return ':' + '-'.repeat(Math.max(width - 2, 1)) + ':';
        if (align === 'right') return '-'.repeat(Math.max(width - 1, 1)) + ':';
        return ':' + '-'.repeat(Math.max(width - 1, 1));
      }

      function csvToMarkdown(raw, align) {
        var rows = parseCsv(raw);
        if (rows.length < 1) throw new Error('No data found.');

        var headers = rows[0].slice();
        var dataRows = rows.slice(1);

        /* rows longer than the header: name the extra columns instead of dropping them */
        var addedColumns = [];
        var colCount = headers.length;
        dataRows.forEach(function (row) { if (row.length > colCount) colCount = row.length; });
        for (var n = headers.length; n < colCount; n++) {
          headers.push('Column ' + (n + 1));
          addedColumns.push('Column ' + (n + 1));
        }

        /* compute column widths */
        var widths = headers.map(function (h) { return Math.max(escapeMd(h).length, 3); });
        dataRows.forEach(function (row) {
          for (var c = 0; c < headers.length; c++) {
            var cell = row[c] !== undefined ? escapeMd(row[c]) : '';
            if (cell.length > widths[c]) widths[c] = cell.length;
          }
        });

        /* header row */
        var headerLine = '| ' + headers.map(function (h, i) {
          return escapeMd(h).padEnd(widths[i]);
        }).join(' | ') + ' |';

        /* separator row */
        var sepLine = '| ' + widths.map(function (w) {
          return sepCell(w + 2, align);
        }).join(' | ') + ' |';

        /* data rows */
        var lines = [headerLine, sepLine];
        dataRows.forEach(function (row) {
          var line = '| ' + headers.map(function (_, c) {
            var cell = row[c] !== undefined ? escapeMd(row[c]) : '';
            return cell.padEnd(widths[c]);
          }).join(' | ') + ' |';
          lines.push(line);
        });

        return { markdown: lines.join('\n'), rowCount: dataRows.length, addedColumns: addedColumns };
      }
      /* ── engine:end ── */

      function doConvert() {
        clearTimeout(_liveTimer);
        resetCopies();
        var raw = csvEl.value.trim();
        if (!raw) { mdEl.value = ''; clearStatus(); return; }
        try {
          var result = csvToMarkdown(raw, currentAlign);
          mdEl.value = result.markdown;
          var msg = rowMsg(result.rowCount);
          if (result.addedColumns.length) msg += ' ' + t.addedColumns.replace('{cols}', result.addedColumns.join(', '));
          setStatus(msg, false);
        } catch (e) {
          mdEl.value = '';
          setStatus(t.errorPrefix + (e.message === 'No data found.' ? t.errNoData : e.message), true);
        }
      }

      /* Analytics: one event per committed change (input change event, alignment click), not per typing pause.
         The same input with the same alignment is sent once. */
      var lastTracked = null;
      function trackChange() {
        if (!mdEl.value) return;
        var key = currentAlign + '\u0000' + csvEl.value;
        if (key === lastTracked) return;
        lastTracked = key;
        window.trackTool && window.trackTool('csv_to_markdown', 'convert');
      }

      /* ── Real-time conversion (debounced 300ms) ── */
      var _liveTimer = null;
      csvEl.addEventListener('input', function () {
        resetCopies();
        clearTimeout(_liveTimer);
        _liveTimer = setTimeout(doConvert, 300);
      });
      csvEl.addEventListener('change', function () {
        doConvert();
        trackChange();
      });

      /* ── Clear ── */
      function clearAll() {
        lastTracked = null;
        clearTimeout(_liveTimer);
        resetCopies();
        csvEl.focus();
        csvEl.value = '';
        mdEl.value = '';
        clearStatus();
      }
      document.getElementById('cm-clear').addEventListener('click', clearAll);
      document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
        if (!(e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey) || e.key.toLowerCase() !== 'l') return;
        var widget = document.querySelector('.cm-wrap');
        if (!widget || !widget.contains(document.activeElement)) return;
        e.preventDefault();
        clearAll();
      });

      /* ── Copy buttons ── */
      function resetCopies() {
        copyStates.forEach(function (state) {
          state.revision++;
          clearTimeout(state.timer);
          state.button.textContent = t.copy;
        });
      }

      function copyText(state, text) {
        if (!text) return;
        var revision = ++state.revision;
        clearTimeout(state.timer);
        function failed() {
          if (revision === state.revision) state.button.textContent = t.copyFailed;
        }
        try {
          navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () {
            if (revision !== state.revision) return;
            state.button.textContent = t.copied;
            state.timer = setTimeout(function () {
              if (revision === state.revision) state.button.textContent = t.copy;
            }, 1500);
          }, failed);
        } catch (e) { failed(); }
      }

      copyCsvBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        copyText(copyStates[0], csvEl.value);
      });

      copyMdBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        copyText(copyStates[1], mdEl.value);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</div>

<style>
  .cm-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; }
  .cm-toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem 0.75rem; flex: none; }
  .cm-control { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem; min-width: 0; }
  .cm-opt-label, .cm-head label { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .cm-align-btns { padding: 0.2rem; gap: 0.2rem; background: var(--color-bg-secondary); }
  .cm-align-btn { padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem; min-height: 32px; border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: transparent; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 0.8rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .cm-align-btn:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }
  .cm-align-btn.active { background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; }
  .cm-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.5rem; min-height: 32px; }
  .cm-head .btn-copy { min-width: 6.75rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cm-box { min-width: 0; overflow: auto; tab-size: 2; }
  .cm-box[readonly] { cursor: default; }
  .cm-empty { display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: center; }
  .cm-result-pane:has(#cm-md:placeholder-shown) .cm-box { display: none; }
  .cm-result-pane:has(#cm-md:placeholder-shown) .cm-empty { display: flex; }
  .cm-status { height: 2.6rem; min-height: 2.6rem; flex: none; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .cm-status.success { color: var(--color-success); }
  .cm-status.error { color: var(--color-danger); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .cm-box { height: 180px; }
    #cm-md { height: 22rem; }
    .cm-status { height: 3.25rem; min-height: 3.25rem; }
    .cm-result-pane:has(#cm-md:placeholder-shown) { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cm-wrap { gap: 0.5rem; }
    .cm-toolbar { gap: 0.25rem 0.5rem; }
    .cm-align-btn, .cm-head { min-height: 44px; }
    #cm-csv { height: 120px; }
  }
</style>
